# Adaptor models

The printable parts are build123d solids in `src/adaptor`. `shared.py` owns the imported hook, pogo pins, prong gussets, grab cylinder, and shell helpers. `wire.py` and `wireless.py` own the board pockets and lids.

Exported STLs are the printable solids only. Do not include board, pogo-pin, or magnet preview geometry in those solids.

Regenerate STLs with `just wire`, `just wireless`, or `just all`. Do not hand-edit files under `models/`.
